        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "h3",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "3. Credit Requests and Payment"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "p",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "To request a Service Credit, Customer must send an email to Capgo at support@capgo.app within thirty (30) days of the end of the month in which the Uptime Commitment was not met. Customer must include either its account ID or registered email address, and the previously reported dates and times that there was no Service Availability. If Capgo confirms that Customer is eligible for a Service Credit, Capgo will issue a credit to Customer's account within thirty (30) days. Service Credits are not refunds, cannot be exchanged into a cash amount, and may only be used against future billing charges. Except as set forth in Section 4 below, the Service Credits shall be Customer's sole and exclusive remedy, and Capgo's sole and exclusive liability, for any failure by Capgo to meet the Uptime Commitment."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "h3",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "4. Definitions"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "p",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "All capitalized words used but not defined in this Service Level Agreement have the meaning set forth in the Agreement."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "h4",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "4.1 Scheduled Availability"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "p",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Scheduled Availability\" means the time, in minutes, that the applicable Services are generally accessible and available to Customer's Permitted Users."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "h4",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "4.2 Unscheduled Downtime"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "p",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Unscheduled Downtime\" means the time, in minutes, that the applicable Services are not generally accessible and available to Customer's Permitted Users, excluding inaccessibility or unavailability due to Customer's or Permitted Users' acts or omissions, force majeure events, scheduled maintenance disclosed with at least 24 hours' notice by email, hacking or virus attacks, reasonable emergency maintenance or other product specific exclusions listed under SLA Exclusions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "h4",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "4.3 Actual Availability"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "p",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Actual Availability\" means Scheduled Availability less Unscheduled Downtime."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "h4",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "4.4 Production"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "p",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Production\" is defined as a system serving live customer-facing or business systems with existing deployed and functional features."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "p",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Development\", \"Staging\", \"uat\", \"pre-production\" or new feature implementation even if in a production environment, are not considered Production."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "h3",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "SLA Exclusions"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "h4",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "General Service Exclusions"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "ul",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "name": "li",
              "props": {
                "class": ""
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "(i) Caused by factors outside of our reasonable control, including but not limited to any force majeure event or Internet access, ISP provider issues, and/or related problems beyond the demarcation point of Capgo."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "name": "li",
              "props": {
                "class": ""
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "(ii) That result from any voluntary actions or inactions from you."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "name": "li",
              "props": {
                "class": ""
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "(iii) That result from instance class CPU and memory resource limitations."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "name": "li",
              "props": {
                "class": ""
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "(iv) That result from you not following the basic operational guidelines described in our Docs."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "name": "li",
              "props": {
                "class": ""
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "(v) That result in a long recovery time due to insufficient IO capacity for your workload."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "name": "li",
              "props": {
                "class": ""
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "(vi) That result from your equipment, software, or other technology."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "name": "li",
              "props": {
                "class": ""
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "(vii) Arising from our suspension and termination of your right to use Capgo in accordance with our Terms."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "h4",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Live Update SLA Exclusions"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "ul",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "name": "li",
              "props": {
                "class": ""
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "(i) Inappropriately provisioned compute resources related to your project for the expected load."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "name": "li",
              "props": {
                "class": ""
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "(ii) Outages caused by overly permissive rate-limiting configurations."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "name": "li",
              "props": {
                "class": ""
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "(iii) Outages or issues caused by retracted versions of official Capgo libraries, frameworks, software packages or APIs, including urgent retractions due to identified security vulnerabilities."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "name": "li",
              "props": {
                "class": ""
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "(iv) Outages or issues caused by unofficial Capgo client libraries, frameworks, or API proxies, even when those libraries internally use official Capgo libraries."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "name": "li",
              "props": {
                "class": ""
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "(v) Outages or issues that could have been resolved by upgrading to a higher minor or patch version of an official Capgo client library, framework, or software package."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "h2",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Support"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "p",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Capgo provides Support Service Level Agreements for our Team and Enterprise customers."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "h3",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "1. Urgent"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "p",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "name": "strong",
              "props": {
                "class": ""
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Critical Issue"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "p",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Defect resulting in full or partial system outage or a condition that makes Capgo unusable or unavailable in production for all of Customer's Users."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "h3",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "2. High"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "p",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "name": "strong",
              "props": {
                "class": ""
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Significant Business Disruption"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "p",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Issue resulting in a situation meaning major functionality is impacted and significant performance degradation is experienced. Issue impacts significant proportion of user base and / or major Capgo functionality."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "h3",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "3. Normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "name": "p",
          "props": {
            "class": ""
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "name": "strong",
              "props": {
                "class": ""
